{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "046ddad7cbdecd92c5da9e922a1898013e17e73b60d9070de9644c2c7db3f0fe", "ja": "新しいお仕事へ！", "zh": "前往新工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a2805ef5a8e8364732dec2ce3605468a0f23509e0e9a08d6e6672f0057cf3036", "ja": "番組は大好評！出演がきっかけで、3人は\nそれぞれの地元から新しい仕事を受ける。\n紬は一日署長、可奈はCM出演、ひなたは\n観光大使。充実した勝負は、3人を\nアイドルとしても成長させたのだった。", "zh": "节目大受好评！以出演节目为契机，3人分别从各自的家乡接到了新的工作。\n紬担任一日署长，可奈出演广告，日向则成为观光大使。充实的较量，也让3人在偶像方面得到了成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6de7b289bf041430a6340ac7c67db795f51f58d851d987f224e2fe89d74bc41e", "ja": "（『好奇心∞無限大！』、3人が出演した回は大好評！\n視聴率、SNSでの評価も非常に高いものとなった）", "zh": "（《好奇心∞无限大！》这一期有3人出演，大获好评！收视率和SNS上的评价也都非常高。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "559bcf64e68a752a231ab7d6f84508d081196f90638588a96158e81e5fa0c20d", "ja": "（番組放送後、3人に呼び出された。\n会議室を使っていいかという事だったけど……）", "zh": "（节目播出后，被3人叫了过去。对方说想借用会议室……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b30cc0874b9d769861360a83062366c9ec1772817159d895f943110392aa67c8", "ja": "つまり！　この3つの柱でコアコンピタンスを獲得し、\nコモディティ化を防げるのです。", "zh": "也就是说！通过这3大支柱获得核心竞争力，就能防止商品同质化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "622310bfb6f83da2e5572bce8c293942a386e9ff1483aff7b009c75d04d27245", "ja": "そして古都とのシナジーにより、発生しうるキャズムを\n解決できる……私はそう信じています。", "zh": "而且，通过与古都的协同效应，就能解决可能出现的鸿沟……我是这么相信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3c020f98f88b24ecac4980bf19d584d14f384b3481e75c171b55715f573a51fb", "ja": "これが、私の考える金沢の未来予想図です。\nご清聴ありがとうございました。", "zh": "这就是我所设想的金泽未来蓝图。\n感谢各位聆听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "8aa15abbe58162e1c91854e9e5f8eb5a2c054e739b8de8221c60ee2f252c00aa", "ja": "はや～……。\nたいしたもんだねぇ。", "zh": "好快啊……。\n真厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "90a89077438f6ed3a343de3afd60d83d782f4f6d712b30aac8a4f1aeb2d5b6a6", "ja": "でも……ほんとのこと言うと、カタカナのところは、\nちょっこし意味がわからなかったんだけども……。", "zh": "不过……说真的，片假名那部分，我有一点没太明白是什么意思……】【。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "2e216a42b1dfb0c48d9dd5a83c598285685c5f3d41b4485fd1cb6957af7cd007", "ja": "よかったぁ、私もだよ～！　紬さん、\nもっとロコちゃんになっちゃったみたい……。", "zh": "太好了，我也是～！紬小姐，\n感觉变得越来越像ROCO了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3b59130763d44c998e8c22a49bd411edf43e19d5ad916b3c19b07b2f7e7a9dad", "ja": "さあ、どうですか{$P$}。\n私の新しいプレゼンは？", "zh": "那么，怎么样，{$P$}？\n我的全新提案如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ecccce00a4abe6146cdc95f9f210e9fee3793b8c49c5e9fb7b5e965bdf3c414e", "ja": "えーと……よく調べたものだと、\n普通に感心したよ。すごかった。", "zh": "那个……你调查得真够仔细的，我确实很佩服。太厉害了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3c91c167c199238f353b555f607fa80f7c6dbda83698ad90207333e3d6152de4", "ja": "そうでしょうとも。\n資料作りに精を出した甲斐がありました。", "zh": "当然了。费心准备资料也是值得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e622629d321323d08eb44243ba88d7145473eca63267785cfaf5e13f44407f72", "ja": "すごい気合いの入れようだな……。\n番組収録は終わったっていうのに。", "zh": "真是干劲十足啊……。\n明明节目录制都结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "3bee907fae4b8e28859801d9d3c4b1c0271decc53d72d4c07756a2fa6014c44d", "ja": "まだ勝負は終わってないってくらいの熱意だべさ。\nでも、気持ちはわかるよぉ。", "zh": "这股热情，简直就像比赛还没结束一样嘛。  \n不过，我能理解你的心情哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "1a4c4490e68bebf726d4e96aa9786cf51a98f83b8ef6be21b7e9a7ed599a9ec3", "ja": "うんうん！　本番はこれから～♪　\nだってだって、お仕事もらえたから～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！正式演出现在才开始～♪  \n因为因为，我们接到工作了嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ae55bd4fa8d1132499c9447d865dcb92b7070ca4d4b644a7e2a5dee621298997", "ja": "はい。あの番組を機に、私たちはそれぞれの\n地元から、お仕事をいただけたのですから。", "zh": "是的。正是因为那档节目，我们才能分别接到来自各自家乡的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7a49cf4a24dc79b2e6ebe317f7be82f2f8deecc1ac58af987df82dba9ed2b0d1", "ja": "それはそうだったな。\n紬は地元金沢での一日署長……。", "zh": "确实是这样。紬在家乡金泽担任一日署长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6facaac219844f255f3eae7d09da673ce8f6575bcdf6e5131f32426d1af2dda5", "ja": "そうです。お仕事に向けて、より広い視野で、\n多角的に地元を見つめて捉え直すため……。", "zh": "没错。为了工作，需要以更广阔的视野、多角度地重新审视并理解家乡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "32b074bd6174b0b82bb034d795cf150cb7a812056762844f3f266dc8ba5cf82c", "ja": "プレゼンという手法で鍛えておくのは、\n理にかなっていると思いました。", "zh": "我觉得，先通过演讲这种方式锻炼自己，是很合理的做法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e065cc19cab0241884184e9b7ac764d20955e7bf1f661c24687e9cbdbc66e5a4", "ja": "もっともではあるし、熱意も素晴らしいな！\nただ、あまり入れ込み過ぎないようにな……。", "zh": "确实很有道理，热情也令人赞叹！\n只是，可别投入过头了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "c53bcaa0240014f8c7315b1d13999882703dd80d4921ca2fe53d3eca88cb3a11", "ja": "私も、お仕事をもらったんですよ～！\nチョコレートの会社さんから、CM出演依頼です♪", "zh": "我也接到工作了哦～！是一家巧克力公司的广告出演邀请♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a1888d9e3a5e1975533ad2cfe591882869e5b768b3c8d488d8f220cf129fcaad", "ja": "うん、可奈の地元横浜の企業さんだったな。\nチョコもたくさん贈られてきてたし。", "zh": "嗯，是可奈的老家横滨那边的企业呢。\n而且对方还送来了好多巧克力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e37678cd4047018770523e3fc61702d13d31776c4720c122a6b8c4072cfa985", "ja": "そうなんですよ～！　あのチョコも\n小さい頃から食べてて、大好きなんです！", "zh": "就是这样～！那种巧克力我从小就一直在吃，最喜欢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "39d2ba562e81ef0b84c2346b2f3f62fc339bb1953be6301f79cb514d2ab3f195", "ja": "太っちゃうのはだめだめ～♪\nでもでも、これはお仕事のため～♪", "zh": "长胖可不行不行～♪\n不过不过，这也是为了工作～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f1481b6cbc06394f3450437b18cf7b8579cf6a29629d951af2f532d03a2823f8", "ja": "うん。撮影の仕事だから、\nきちんとセーブしないとだな……。", "zh": "嗯。因为是拍摄工作，\n还是得好好控制一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "07cf9c155448bc4540f457eab245ed464601db0d74d8fc4af2294914506cf164", "ja": "あたしは、今回も観光大使のお仕事を頂いたよぉ。\n地元に呼んでもらえるのは、やっぱしうれしいねぇ。", "zh": "这次我也接到了观光大使的工作哦。\n能被邀请回家乡，果然还是很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "c5555c9933acf6689abe943f9d88f778e64324aefe913ea1f7949a00d18d914e", "ja": "オファーってのをもらったって聞いて、\nすぐ、ばあちゃんに報告しちゃったべさ。", "zh": "听说拿到了邀约，我马上就向奶奶报告了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "11b389bc485653c9f29af0f468ba106f8339f6173cc12573643281c2628e7bcb", "ja": "木下さんのプレゼンは、特筆すべきものでしたから。\n当然の成果かと思います。", "zh": "木下小姐的演示非常出色，所以我认为这是理所当然的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "0837332c02fd421c5750fc1697f4b30d24e3e8c651a4946ed7fe78aa2b1bf7f0", "ja": "うん！　私だったら、\nずーっとひなたちゃんにお願いしちゃうと思う！", "zh": "嗯！要是我的话，也会一直拜托日向的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "ab4ee29ca229f6090a033b8a7e7fbc7d83466436da2907da36580a5e9b04a313", "ja": "ありがとねぇ、ふたりとも。そういえば、\nさっそくりんごが届いてるんだよぉ。", "zh": "谢谢你们呀，两位。话说回来，\n马上就收到寄来的苹果了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e68a60ccaa5e6ea4665322948aacb61dee0b30ac58010d5e2c1b8a0b56c1b5a", "ja": "観光大使の、就任祝いにって。\nいつもの倍くらい送ってきてくれてねぇ。", "zh": "说是为了庆祝我就任观光大使，寄来了差不多平时两倍的量呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ad3e42be472f753d732d2c4c632671b4a8bd19961fe2d3f6cbc3c5224b85ca3", "ja": "倍も……。きっと彼方くん、\nがんばって磨いてくれたんでしょうね。", "zh": "竟然有两倍这么多……彼方君一定是努力帮忙打磨过的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "79dbe922acfc82fb40384a356fdf80bc53541dee82fe5e54f8d025b77f279ced", "ja": "ありがたいな～♪　美味しくいただきたいな～♪", "zh": "太感谢啦～♪　真想快点美味地吃掉呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_07_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "ff6d96b78ccba5c9058aefcb68c5912fed9f7e66b1b83077b97857f8a296da56", "ja": "もう劇場の冷蔵庫で冷やしてあるよぉ。\nうちのりんごは、栄養たっぷりだからねぇ。", "zh": "已经放在剧场的冰箱里冰好了哦。\n我们家的苹果可是营养满满的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
